{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05这类只有18—19秒的段落，Y的话语和完整感受描述同时出现，扫读压力明显高于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过加亮关键语句，让人物每一阶段的心理转折和因果关系更容易被抓住；感受部分又把声音变化、身体体验和情绪变化联系起来，水波、船、呼吸等意象也形成了前后呼应。X的短词确实更容易快速扫过，但不少词语只是并列提示，观众还需要自己拼接它们之间的关系。总体而言，Y虽然阅读负担更大，却让人更容易理解这个人为什么这样想、为什么这样变化，也更能感受到音乐与人物内心之间细腻而具体的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6506e9d0-e5e7-4790-9fa7-c716d490bf7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T024108655171Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:41:42.122898+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "93abe36cf9bad58792801fb45240cf9775a1787aaef156daa81f09404bd7d6d7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web